come from the Alzheimer's Disease Neuroimaging Initiative (ADNI) and are
governed by the ADNI Data Use Agreement, not by this licence. Neither the raw
images, the participant-level derivatives (connectome matrices, tractograms,
per-subject tables), nor the clinical tables may be redistributed under these
terms. Obtain data directly from https://adni.loni.usc.edu/ under your own DUA.
Publications using ADNI data must follow the ADNI publication policy, including
the required authorship acknowledgement and submission to the ADNI Data and
Publications Committee.

Third-party assets.  The AAL3 atlas (Rolls et al., 2020) and the Schaefer 2018
parcellation are redistributed here under their own respective licences and are
not covered by the MIT grant above. The derived look-up tables and network
mapping files authored for this project (aal3_node_map_166.csv,
AAL3_network_mapping.csv and its notes) are covered by the MIT grant.

